  (text "Each square: reed to GND, 10k to 3V3, signal into CD74HC4067. Channel n on mux m is square index m*16+n in a1,b1.. order. E is tied to GND so the mux stays enabled. S0 is GPIO25 bit0. COM outputs are SIG1..SIG4 into GPIO32,33,34,35." (at 110 210 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)))
    (uuid "2370090a-6b85-4df9-a0a1-93fac64c02a6"))
